### <%= member_heading(@method) %>

<%- if @method.constructor? -%>
*(Ruby's default constructor; documents `#initialize`.)*

<%- end -%>
<%- overloads = @method.tags(:overload) -%>
<%- if overloads.size >= 2 -%>
<%- lines = annotation_lines(@method) -%>
<%- unless lines.empty? -%>
<%= lines.join("\n") %>

<%- end -%>
<%- unless @method.docstring.empty? -%>
<%= markdownify(@method.docstring) %>
<%- end -%>
<%- examples = examples_block(@method) -%>
<%- if examples -%>

<%= examples %>
<%- end -%>
<%- overloads.each do |ov| -%>

```ruby
<%= signature_text(@method, overload: ov) %>
```
<%- unless ov.tags(:param).empty? -%>

**Params:**

<%- ov.tags(:param).each do |p| -%>
- `<%= p.name %>` (<%= type_ref(p.types && p.types.first) %>)<%= summary_suffix(p.text) %>
<%- end -%>
<%- end -%>
<%- ov_return = ov.tag(:return) -%>
<%- if ov_return -%>

**Returns:**

- <%= dash_join(type_ref(ov_return.types && ov_return.types.first), ov_return.text) %>
<%- end -%>
<%- end -%>
<%- else -%>
<%- primary = overloads.first -%>
```ruby
<%= signature_text(@method, overload: primary) %>
```
<%- lines = annotation_lines(@method) -%>
<%- unless lines.empty? -%>

<%= lines.join("\n") %>
<%- end -%>
<%- unless @method.docstring.empty? -%>

<%= markdownify(@method.docstring) %>
<%- end -%>
<%- examples = examples_block(@method) -%>
<%- if examples -%>

<%= examples %>
<%- end -%>
<%- param_tags = primary ? primary.tags(:param) : @method.tags(:param) -%>
<%- unless param_tags.empty? -%>

**Params:**

<%- param_tags.each do |p| -%>
- `<%= p.name %>` (<%= type_ref(p.types && p.types.first) %>)<%= summary_suffix(p.text) %>
<%- end -%>
<%- end -%>
<%- end -%>
<%- yt = yield_tag(@method) -%>
<%- if yt -%>
<%- yt_names = yt.types || [] -%>

**Yields:**

- <%= dash_join(yt_names.empty? ? "" : yt_names.map { |n| "`#{n}`" }.join(', '), yt.text) %>
<%- end -%>
<%- unless @method.tags(:yieldparam).empty? -%>

**Yield Params:**

<%- @method.tags(:yieldparam).each do |p| -%>
- `<%= p.name %>` (<%= type_ref(p.types && p.types.first) %>)<%= summary_suffix(p.text) %>
<%- end -%>
<%- end -%>
<%- yieldreturn_tags = @method.tags(:yieldreturn) -%>
<%- unless yieldreturn_tags.empty? -%>

**Yield Returns:**

<%- yieldreturn_tags.each do |yrt| -%>
- <%= dash_join(type_ref(yrt.types && yrt.types.join(", ")), yrt.text) %>
<%- end -%>
<%- end -%>
<%- if overloads.size < 2 -%>
<%- return_tags = primary ? primary.tags(:return) : method_return_tags(@method) -%>
<%- unless return_tags.empty? -%>

**Returns:**

<%- return_tags.each do |rt| -%>
- <%= dash_join(type_ref(rt.types && rt.types.join(", ")), rt.text) %>
<%- end -%>
<%- end -%>
<%- end -%>
<%- unless @method.tags(:raise).empty? -%>

**Raises:**

<%- @method.tags(:raise).each do |r| -%>
- <%= dash_join(type_ref(r.types && r.types.first), r.text) %>
<%- end -%>
<%- end -%>
<%- unless @method.tags(:see).empty? -%>

**See also:** <%= @method.tags(:see).map { |t| see_ref(t) }.join(', ') %>
